"standalone daemon does the work."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid "Marc-Antoine Perennou"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid ""
"GPaste is a clipboard managing system allowing you to track and manage your "
"clipboard history in a highly customizable way."
msgstr ""
"GPaste는 클립보드 돌보기 시스템으로 사용자 정의가 가능한 방식으로 클립보드 기"
"록을 추적하고 돌보기 할 수 있다."

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid ""
"GPaste provides you with a graphical tool allowing you to manage everything "
"easily."
msgstr "GPaste는 모든 것을 쉽게 돌보기 할 수 있는 그래픽 도구를 제공합니다."

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:27
msgid "The main UI"
msgstr "메인 UI"

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:31
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:35
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:39
msgid "The settings UI"
msgstr "셋팅 UI"

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:51
#, fuzzy
msgid "This is a major release. Changes:"
msgstr "이것은 돌보기하기 릴리스입니다. 바낀 것:"

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:53
msgid ""
"Encrypt the history at rest with an optional encrypted file backend, and "
"remember its passphrase in the keyring"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:54
msgid ""
"Add SQLite storage backends, plain and encrypted, that store the history in "
"a per-history database and images as blobs"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:55
msgid ""
"Choose where the history is stored and move it there, from a migration "
"dialog, the preferences or gpaste-client"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:56
msgid ""
"Change the passphrase of an encrypted history from the preferences or gpaste-"
"client"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:57
msgid ""
"Optionally run the daemon inside the GNOME Shell extension, watching the "
"clipboard through mutter (experimental)"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:58
msgid ""
"Rewrite the history as a scrollable, lazily-loaded list in both the GNOME "
"Shell extension and the graphical tool"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:59
msgid "Add a merge mode to combine several history items"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:60
msgid ""
"Pin items as favourites, which the size and memory limits never drop, and "
"filter the history down to them"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:61
msgid ""
"Bump the DBus interface to org.gnome.GPaste3, renaming Element to Item and "
"carrying each item's kind and favourite state with it"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:62
msgid "Enlarge image previews on hover via a custom tooltip"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:63
msgid "Publish copied colours as text on the clipboard as well"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:64
msgid ""
"Capture keyboard shortcuts in the preferences instead of typing them, and "
"reset any preference from a right-click menu"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:65
msgid ""
"Make the embeddable preferences widget adaptive, and remember the window "
"geometry across sessions"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:66
msgid "Raise the default retention, element and memory limits"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:67
msgid ""
"Drop the internal X11 keybinder and the GNOME Shell keybinding client, "
"leaving keyboard shortcuts to the XDG portal"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:68
msgid "Build: require GLib 2.90, GTK 4.24 and libadwaita 1.10"
msgstr ""

