#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:76
msgid ""
"Fix selecting a history in the UI sidebar doing nothing, and, when a "
"history's context menu was open, switching to that one instead of the one "
"clicked"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:84
msgid ""
"Fix the daemon deadlocking against itself when copying, most often on larger "
"items (text selections are now served by a dedicated content provider "
"instead of being serialized by GTK)"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:85
msgid ""
"text/plain is now served as UTF-8, where GTK's serializer encoded it as "
"ASCII and replaced anything else with '?'"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:86
msgid "Fix a deadlock when selecting an item that turns out to be invalid"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:87
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:178
msgid ""
"Fix the daemon crashing when searching from the GNOME Shell overview with a "
"term containing an unbalanced bracket or parenthesis"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:88
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:179
msgid ""
"Fix the history file being destroyed when it had been written by a newer "
"version of GPaste"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:89
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:180
msgid ""
"Fix items being lost or garbled when loading a history containing an item "
"with an empty value"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:90
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:181
msgid ""
"Fix every client crashing, GNOME Shell included, on the first update sent by "
"a newer daemon after \"gpaste-client daemon-reexec\""
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:91
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:182
msgid ""
"Fix the daemon aborting, instead of disabling search, when it cannot connect "
"to its own D-Bus proxy"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:92
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:183
msgid ""
"Fix \"gpaste-client help\", \"version\", \"ui\" and \"preferences\" failing "
"when no daemon is reachable"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:93
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:184
msgid ""
"Fix \"gpaste-client file\" crashing on a file that is neither text nor a "
"loadable image"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:94
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:185
msgid ""
"Fix a critical on every keystroke when the GTK UI search term is not a valid "
"regular expression"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:95
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:186
msgid ""
"Fix acting on history rows before their content has been loaded, in both the "
"GTK UI and the GNOME Shell extension"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:96
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:187
msgid ""
"Fix a second \"gpaste-ui\" or \"gpaste-preferences\" invocation failing "
"instead of presenting the running window"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:97
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:188
msgid ""
"Fix several memory leaks and a use-after-free in the GTK UI history panel"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:98
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:189
msgid ""
"Fix the \"empty history\" helpers reporting success when the operation had "
"failed"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:106
msgid ""
"Fix the active history item overriding the clipboard when copying an image "
"while images support is disabled (such content is now left untouched in the "
"clipboard, while still not being added to the history)"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:114
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:197
msgid ""
"Fix the daemon failing to restart with \"gpaste-client daemon-reexec\" (the "
"re-exec path was missing the gpaste libexec subdirectory)"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:122
msgid ""
"GNOME Shell extension: fix history items gradually disappearing from the menu"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:123
msgid ""
"UI: fix keyboard input so Escape and Enter no longer swallow text meant for "
"the search or history switch entries, and type-to-search works right after "
"startup"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:131
